        "slc_cb91f02ea23efa473fe5ec0ab3b0256747b626e86a5a0c16834765732ad30e94"
      ],
      "text": "When wired into an agent, the Loopsy MCP server exposes tools for peer listing, remote command execution, long-lived PTY sessions, file transfer, a shared key/value context store, messaging with ACKs, and read receipts."
    },
