        "slc_a0e39033ecf41b20e20fe78d438b02750f8340a01a2ba745b310305e2a1f23a4"
      ],
      "text": "The repository is a pnpm monorepo with packages for shared protocol types, mDNS discovery, a Fastify daemon, a Cloudflare Worker relay, a deploy-relay npx CLI, the loopsy CLI, an MCP server, a dashboard, and a Flutter mobile app."
    },
