        "slc_6b5eaefe840d66f1d2467ae169099ad36cdcc5077714ca8447e5966868a67216"
      ],
      "text": "Phone control works by the daemon opening an outbound WebSocket to a Cloudflare Worker (Durable Object) that the phone also connects to; the Worker splices the two connections, requiring no port forwarding, public IP, or VPN."
    },
